                        "sense_id": "feb06f40-f5af-3506-b74c-2ce9afa5f9be",
                        "entry_id": "ed60942e-e430-3b31-ba0b-2266a92304ab",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a lumpy manner, with lumps."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8baaea58-51e1-4983-91dd-ef8dd1c625ea",
                                "sense_id": "feb06f40-f5af-3506-b74c-2ce9afa5f9be",
                                "text": "I had no idea that anything in the shape of a horse could be so limp as that, either living or dead. His wild mane hung down lumpily, a mere mass of inanimate horsehair; his aggressive ears had collapsed, but as he went swaying slowly across the front of the bridge I noticed an astute gleam in his dreamy, half-closed eye."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aac5f438-ea74-4ca5-9466-001151242a5a",
                                "sense_id": "feb06f40-f5af-3506-b74c-2ce9afa5f9be",
                                "text": "An hour later, he had paid about $3.25, been talked through the workings of a small bank of stainless-steel machines, and was leaving with a bag of fluffy if lumpily folded clothes."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fe2919cc-ece0-3006-904e-7978da54b37e",
                        "entry_id": "ed60942e-e430-3b31-ba0b-2266a92304ab",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Like a lump; awkwardly, heavily, ponderously."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cb3f2fd1-731a-4804-8c69-bd80d32a36db",
                                "sense_id": "fe2919cc-ece0-3006-904e-7978da54b37e",
                                "text": "He'd stuck his hands in his pockets as I came in, and he sat down lumpily in his chair."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "df528ec9-6c93-4fda-9f7c-6e51c1c38de4",
                                "sense_id": "fe2919cc-ece0-3006-904e-7978da54b37e",
                                "text": "“You’ll feel better when you’ve drunk this’m,” said the parlourmaid lumpily, pouring out some tea."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dd843a8e-8b62-4608-abb6-835f881176b4",
                                "sense_id": "fe2919cc-ece0-3006-904e-7978da54b37e",
                                "text": "What ever became of the chaos in Laos? Last year at this time the pro-Communist Pathet Lao were strutting lumpily across the Plain of Jars in their dun-colored uniforms, proudly triumphant over the “neutralist” forces of General Kong Le and threatening to overrun the entire country."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "133707a0-5e2d-4188-a3b7-b31e2c36178a",
                                "sense_id": "fe2919cc-ece0-3006-904e-7978da54b37e",
                                "text": "This extraordinary life probably needed a solidly presented non-fiction film; what we have here is an odd and lumpily constructed drama-doc with daytime-telly production values, featuring some very hammy acting and direction."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
